notes:
These are primary sources the csoh.org kill chain cites. Every fact about the incident in this deck comes from that page, which draws on these.

Huntress's report is the main account of the campaign. Microsoft Learn's emergency revocation page is the guidance the page compares with Huntress's containment order. The Hacker News's coverage carries the 97-account headline. ANY.RUN's analysis of the SkyW4lker kit is separate from this campaign, and neither it nor Huntress connects the two. The four MITRE pages define the techniques at stages 02 to 05.

The page also cites the MITRE page for T1564.008, the technique at stage 06.

The background slides name their own sources: Microsoft Learn and the csoh.org glossary.

